{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_lasher_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lasher_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"遗失之物","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lasher_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f57161ecace8a7cf46a605d2eb58b0fb44ce80b067e46c3a3186f09fc988bd8a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"大巴扎拍卖会临近，而重要的拍卖品却突然遗失。出于对职责与使命的坚守，拉恕尔会尽力而为。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奥，米奥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不耐烦地甩尾巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事啊，米奥......？从昨天开始就一直昏昏欲睡的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，该不会真的病了吧......让我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*古萨尔贡俚语*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别扒我的眼皮，没规矩的仆从！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再这样，我就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奥？又昏过去了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，拉恕尔，我们没你想象的那么脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拍卖会就快要召开了，还有很多事需要准备，我要赶紧出门了......沃奥，可以请你帮我照看米奥吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和米奥都知道，除了找守护者的宝石，你还有很多别的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我们，把你有限的精力，放在更重要的事情上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丢了？你们说......“落星”丢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起！我们找了一晚上，库房的每个角落都翻遍了，可还是没找到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是本次拍卖会最重磅的宝石拍品......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人......拍卖会就快要召开了，我们现在该怎么办......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多雅德，你先去联系最近几天来过库房的所有访客，特别是曾问过或接触过“落星”的人，一个也别落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿巴斯，你去做一套拍卖会延期的预案，评估场地改期费用和委托违约赔偿金的总额。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会去联系新的拍卖品委托方，看看能不能找到比“落星”更好的拍卖品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家不必太过慌张，总会有办法的。先齐心协力把拍卖会的事情处理好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所员工们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是！我们先按您说的去办了，拉恕尔大人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还以为会被直接开除。原来交易所的员工总是被换，不是他们犯错的缘故吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，真让人猝不及防。每当大事临头，总会出点岔子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能找到就好了......我多希望这只是一场噩梦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g11_grandbazaar_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，如果您有愿意委托给拍卖会拍卖的宝石，就再好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"为难的商铺老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉......前些天有收购商把店里相对好些的宝石全都买走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必道歉，本来也是我唐突来访。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的商铺老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人，我已经把我的货品都给您看过了，这里没有能满足您要求的宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我再去别的商铺看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的商铺老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，拉恕尔大人，您看这枚水晶胸针怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的瑕疵很明显，恐怕没法当成重磅拍卖品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的商铺老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么不能的？您只要给它开个亮眼的价格，就比其他拍卖品的估价高那么一点点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的商铺老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是监管人的出价，就不存在什么弄虚作假......只要您愿意，好处什么的，都好说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g11_grandbazaar_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......拉恕尔大人，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事，阿巴斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我有个坏消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚王酋使者来通知我们，有位名叫索斯比的外国富商过几天会来米城，他和王酋有很多重要合作，让我们一定要好好招待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索斯比先生就是冲着拍卖会上有着保健功效的宝石来的，考虑到他的行程安排，我们就算要延期举办，也没法推迟太久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且使者说，索斯比先生此前看过拍卖会的宣传单，很好奇“落星”到底是如何发挥保健功效的，所以他想在预展会上提前看看货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索斯比先生会在这里待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他之后还要去汐斯塔参加音乐节......所以最多待一个星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把延期后的拍卖会，安排在他临走前那一天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和“落星”接触过的人，多雅德调查得怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"确认过了，都可以排除嫌疑......真的是怪事了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......拉恕尔大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有别的事，我就先挂了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问您有没有遇到什么困难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，这里是四尾鳞家政服务公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维修电器、清洁管道、除灭虫害、找寻失物，我们致力于为您的生活排忧解难！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果有需要，欢迎您随时拨打本电话......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？可是您的声音听起来很疲惫，真的不需要吗？请您再考虑一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，您请尽管说，有任何困难我们都会尽力帮您解决！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客气的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者，您先存一下我司电话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，刚刚那个人是不是说过......“找寻失物”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我在想什么？我居然想让一个来路不明的家政公司帮忙找一件失踪的贵重拍卖品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再寄希望于找到“落星”了......我必须想想别的办法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"一条黑暗狭窄的小巷。从商铺鳞次栉比的大巴扎返回交易所，这是最近的通道。\n年轻的监管人孑然独行，他听见议论声从砖瓦缝隙间传来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墙后议论的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，看上去交易所又出乱子了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墙后议论的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，有什么可担心的，这又不是第一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墙后议论的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人对每次拍卖会都特别上心......但就算办不好一次，又会怎样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墙后议论的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，怎么会办不好？只要那些有着神奇功效的宝石还会汇集到米纳特哈玛仪，就不会办不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墙后议论的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你走着瞧吧，有拉恕尔大人在，这回的拍卖会肯定会是最成功的一次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"监管人想起，孩童时自己常常躲在这条黑暗的小巷，让母亲和外祖父到处寻找。\n那时他天真地觉得，只要这样，就能让他们打开那扇厚重的砖色大门，从漫长的职责与罪孽中走出来。\n可他现在却对每一位祖先曾在这里行走时的沉重心情，无比深切地感同身受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，一个熟悉的身影停在他的身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃奥？你怎么找过来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经很晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，都这么晚了......本来我应该多陪陪你们的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奥怎么样......恢复精神了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起米奥，你更应该担心你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，拉恕尔，回去好好睡一觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有点头痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让你好好休息，你却偏要熬夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，我要把参会的买家资料都看一遍，没多少时间了，我得抓紧了解他们的需要与喜好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，沃奥，你说我要不要找个宠物医生来看看米奥的情况？我还是有点担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过的，如果我们不想让人类接近，对方根本就不可能看见我们，放弃这个念头吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别舔手腕这里呀，好痒......沃奥，好啦，我知道，你想让我摸摸头，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（仰起头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，对不起，这两天有点忽视你们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，米奥也不会有事。我们更希望你别忽视自己的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，笑得这么勉强，就像照片上的这个人一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照片......？你是说索斯比先生的这张吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。明明跟他合照的其他人都笑得灿烂，他倒好，只是挤一挤嘴角，连牙齿都不露的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还真是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，他资料里的其他照片也都是这样......就连和他最爱的乐队合影时也一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这能说明什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说明你可能帮了我大忙了，沃奥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法尔希德先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚起床秘书就给我安排了紧急会面日程，我还奇怪呢，原来是拉恕尔大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事需要劳您大驾亲自光临呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今日前来，是想与你做个交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你的收藏中有一颗铭刻工艺极为高超的黄绿宝石，无论是它的功效还是它的外观，都无可挑剔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您是指“沙海之日”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，拉恕尔大人是想把我的“沙海之日”打造成重磅拍卖品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你知道了我的意图，那接下来就都好说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信法尔希德先生也一定知道，监管人极少主动走出大巴扎，与不做宝石生意的市民谈生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？我以为您的母亲和外祖父从不找我谈生意，是因为他们并不喜欢我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让我做宝石商人的时候不守规矩呢。他们是怎么说的来着？我擅自用他们的名号来哄抬宝石的价格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实这么做了，这违背了我们建立宝石交易所的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我的宝石经营许可证被吊销了。好在天无绝人之路......我的广告公司倒是发展得还算不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜我的那些宝石珍藏，只能都堆在家里，留给我独自欣赏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此看来，法尔希德先生是打算拒绝我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，打扰了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，您等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为米城市民，我当然愿意支持新上任的监管人的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是交易所的委托费用毕竟不是一笔小数目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交易所会为你免除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......我的经营许可？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以先向交易所提交恢复申请，经过一段时间的观察，我会给你通过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有观察期呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请不要得寸进尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......好，已经足够了，很有诚意。就这么定了，稍晚些时候，我会把“沙海之日”送去交易所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里做生意的人都知道，拉恕尔大人您一诺千金。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人，该不会法尔希德那家伙没同意吧，我之前听说他跟交易所关系不太好来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看您面色铁青，我还以为您吃了闭门羹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，这是您让我调查的索斯比先生近期的消费记录。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在看的是......他的医疗美容消费记录？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"项目是......牙齿美白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看来我们的方向没有找错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我还有一个很小很小的请求！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近嘛，我的公司运营得也不太顺利，没做出啥爆款广告，但这回，我有一个绝佳的点子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是要宣传“沙海之日”，还是要颠覆市民们心中对交易所过于庄重、严肃的印象，它都能起到很大作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们对交易所的印象，不需要被颠覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，当然更多也是为我的公司增加点话题度和曝光度嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“沙海之日”的事是您有求于我......这回就当是我有求于您，我们互有所求，不就是做生意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定不会拒绝我的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）拉恕尔大人，这家伙现在完全就是趁人之危，漫天要价......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你到底需要我做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，既然要上拍卖会，我打算为“沙海之日”做一套宣传海报......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝石收藏家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我觉得拉恕尔大人您，就是海报模特的不二人选。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咱们来试一下，等我说完词，您就扬起下巴，露出牙齿，笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g4_ctizengarden"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，对！您再往右一点，脸紧贴着雕像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是说......请您露齿微笑，这样才能展现“沙海之日”的非凡功效啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"青春一点！阳光一点！咧开嘴笑吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不，别皱眉头啊......等等，倒是抓拍到一张，还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多雅德，这到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法尔希德那家伙到底有什么魔法，居然能让拉恕尔大人答应亲自来当洁牙广告的模特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来话长......总之你小心点，我猜拉恕尔大人肯定满肚子火，你可别撞铳口上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，这里就先这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海报摄影师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您可能太紧张了，我们换个您更熟悉的场景。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些海报可真不错，它们会在交易所和大巴扎的墙上贴多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最多到拍卖会结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留着吧，我还挺喜欢背景是交易所的这张，笑得很自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提这事了，沃奥......我的脸到现在还是僵的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米奥它还在睡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是多睡几天而已。以前，我和米奥可一连睡过好几百年的觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉恕尔，等拍卖会结束了，你也该好好休息一阵了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道，就算是平常，交易所和大巴扎的琐事也绝对不算少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你厌倦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是最近偶尔会做一些奇怪的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦里的我似乎不是交易所柜台后的监管人，而是被放飞出去的发条羽兽，漫无目的地飞过街道，风大的时候就落下休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（悠哉地翻身）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（自在地摇尾巴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像米奥这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，也许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......米奥要是再不醒来，可就要错过这次的拍卖会了，本想让你们也一起留意城外商人们带来的消息的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守护者的宝石，还有两颗下落未明啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔，在寻找守护者宝石的同时，我希望你铭记，你的时光也很有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的时光有限，但监管人的一生到宝石归还之日才会结束。我只是在做我该做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且，我也希望你们与那位宝库守护者早一些重逢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，对于你和米奥来说，他很重要吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔，你上一次拍私人照片，是什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次......好像是母亲还在世的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过段时间，请拍海报的摄影师帮我们一起拍个合影吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我也不确定，他的镜头能不能把我和米奥拍进去，但至少，你会知道我们在你的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃奥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啊，我很乐意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"拍卖会当天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索斯比先生，需要茶或者咖啡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，就给我一杯不添加任何色素的柠檬水就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，您请用。如果您有任何需要，可以随时呼叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉恕尔大人说得没错，索斯比先生确实是有一口大黄牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他有没有问“落星”的事......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一句也没提。他一直攥着“沙海之日”的宣传单呢，就是有拉恕尔大人照片的那张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这回他是志在必得啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我们将竞拍本届拍卖会的重磅拍品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它比萨尔贡的炎阳更加耀眼，感谢我们的委托方，法尔希德先生为我们带来的珍奇宝石——“沙海之日”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起拍价——九百万第纳尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一千一百万，一千三百万，一千五百万，一千七百万......还有人继续出价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，索斯比先生，一千九百万，感谢您的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米城富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来自提坦金饰的夏尔玛女士，两千一百万，也感谢您的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米城富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（举牌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两千三百万，两千五百万，两千七百万......目前的最高出价是两千九百万，来自魔瓶商会的哈沐德先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，索斯比先生，您这是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就把我的牌子放在这了，刚才那个员工呢？快，别管用源石技艺还是什么别的办法，给我把我的牌子钉在墙上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你们怎么出价，我这牌子都一直举着！不放下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看还有谁要跟我抢“沙海之日”？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，索斯比先生开价三千一百万。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成交！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，感觉好不真实......拍卖会圆满结束，危机就这么解决了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所男员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到索斯比先生他那么满意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"交易所女员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，早跟你说过了，拉恕尔大人一定能带着我们化险为夷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没法向你们保证每次都能完美收场。而且，“落星”也还没找到啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？你说......米奥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有呼吸了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奥、米奥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了......呼吸真的好微弱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你坚持一会儿，我这就带你去找医生......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你说过了，找医生也没有用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃奥，帮我一把，我要先把米奥抱起来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，什么东西从垫子里掉出来了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸懒腰）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（张大嘴打哈欠）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一颗宝石......这......这是失踪的“落星”，它怎么会在米奥的睡垫下面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说什么，拉恕尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......米奥，你终于醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，原来是“落星”让你陷入昏睡的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一颗有着安神助眠功效的宝石。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明之前的拍品介绍上有写，我早该想到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为监管人，你难道不应该看管好这种如此危险的宝石吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就连身为兽主的我都能被放倒，它的能量真是不容小觑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要拿去玩，倒是跟我说一声啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为这颗宝石丢了，可让我忙坏了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（盯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你这是在责怪我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是想啊，谁知道刚抱着它躺了一会儿，我就完全没有意识了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都睡着了，还怎么跟你说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......这不主要是你的错吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你早点把我抱起来，让我离开这颗宝石的影响范围，我就不会睡这么久，你也能找到宝石了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你有没有哪里不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了突然被你吵醒，也没什么不舒服的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎，你这小人类，在傻乐什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......没什么，没什么，只要你没事就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的，你抱得太紧了......拉恕尔！我可还没原谅你呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
